OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy
OL,6,Fshowers across the southwest clearing
OL,7,Faway this evening, then mainly dry and
OL,8,Frather cloudy overnight. Some clear
OL,9,Fspells will develop in the west.
OL,10,FBreezy around the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMostly cloudy in the east
OL,13,Fwith the best of the brightness in the
OL,14,Fwest. A few scattered showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping, then outbreaks of heavy
OL,16,Fand thundery rain possible in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
